MergeMain [label: "Merge to main", icon: git-merge, color: blue]
Source [label: "CodePipeline Source GitHubSource main DetectChanges=true", icon: github, color: purple]
ArtifactBucket [label: "S3 artifact bucket", icon: archive, color: gray]
CodeBuild [label: "CodeBuild skn28-container-build", icon: hammer, color: purple]
BackendBuild [label: "docker build backend", icon: box, color: orange]
FrontendBuild [label: "docker build frontend_migration", icon: box, color: orange]
ExternalBuild [label: "docker build external_mcp", icon: box, color: orange]
BackendRepo [label: "ECR skn28/backend:<commit12>", icon: container, color: "#0f766e"]
FrontendRepo [label: "ECR skn28/frontend-migration:<commit12>", icon: container, color: "#0f766e"]
ExternalRepo [label: "ECR skn28/external-mcp:<commit12>", icon: container, color: "#0f766e"]
ImageDefinitions [label: "imagedefinitions json artifacts", icon: file-json, color: gray]
DeployExternal [label: "ECS deploy external MCP runOrder 1", icon: rocket, color: green]
DeployBackend [label: "ECS deploy backend runOrder 2", icon: rocket, color: green]
DeployFrontend [label: "ECS deploy frontend migration runOrder 3", icon: rocket, color: green]
ExternalSvc [label: "skn28-demo-external-mcp task definition :9", icon: server, color: "#2563eb"]
BackendSvc [label: "skn28-demo-backend task definition :9", icon: server, color: "#2563eb"]
FrontendSvc [label: "skn28-demo-frontend-migration task definition :9", icon: server, color: "#2563eb"]

Developer > PullRequest: review
PullRequest > MergeMain: merge
MergeMain > Source: main update
Source > ArtifactBucket: SourceOutput
ArtifactBucket > CodeBuild: BuildOutput input
CodeBuild > BackendBuild: backend/Dockerfile
CodeBuild > FrontendBuild: frontend_migration/Dockerfile
CodeBuild > ExternalBuild: external_mcp/Dockerfile
BackendBuild > BackendRepo: docker push
FrontendBuild > FrontendRepo: docker push
ExternalBuild > ExternalRepo: docker push
BackendRepo > ImageDefinitions: backend.json
FrontendRepo > ImageDefinitions: frontend-migration.json
ExternalRepo > ImageDefinitions: external-mcp.json
ImageDefinitions > DeployExternal: runOrder 1
DeployExternal > ExternalSvc: update service
DeployExternal > DeployBackend: then
DeployBackend > BackendSvc: update service
DeployBackend > DeployFrontend: then
DeployFrontend > FrontendSvc: update service
